{"title":"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/1/ee15875abbf1d71d5648b6d5c00e6067ca53c18d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = 1, 2, 3, 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" />, define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d123e747192aeb647e36b9055d989bd52d4e3355.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_t = \\sum_{i = 1}^{350}a_i^t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"84\" height=\"50\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ef28e002237e264113993c7db4beecd620c59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i \\in \\{1,2,3,4\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/1/e41102bd1aca07bc90d08f5deac14d1f18345e3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1 = 513$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/5/4e555538d3021936b9616276a45ae52a8f2254e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_4 = 4745$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" />, find the minimum possible value for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/4/7f4caea56d945d0b6e49701b42ce06e0fb92e663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because the order of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />'s doesn't matter, we simply need to find the number of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s that minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/4/7f4caea56d945d0b6e49701b42ce06e0fb92e663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" />. So let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/e/bbe3445a9d6f21a67f0cc2181ff272fd30395841.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w, x, y,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"53\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> represent the number of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s respectively. Then we can write three equations based on these variables. Since there are a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/e/9ceffeb3d880c80aa8bb29fe99a7905ca0b2f719.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$350$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />s, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/a/8baac705af8329347526c8f128e8ebfbc5174217.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w + x + y + z = 350$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"160\" height=\"16\" />. We also know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/c/81c0950e9022b11628304aea275dc940485cd1eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w + 2x + 3y + 4z = 513$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"187\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/7/5472efb7fe04eab608ec6cb3558f6488f0067b13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w + 16x + 81y + 256z = 4745$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"233\" height=\"16\" />. We can now solve these down to two variables:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2efaf625d834188161eb8a033fba648bb0286a80.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[w = 350 - x - y - z\\]\" width=\"159\" height=\"16\" />\nSubstituting this into the second and third equations, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/e/3be0445083f31b8826ca1c819f412b6f54e00edd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x + 2y + 3z = 163\\]\" width=\"142\" height=\"16\" />\nand\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/7/d1712bbcb227a1dd16ff28d3dc7f3e3db6258e50.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[15x + 80y + 255z = 4395.\\]\" width=\"199\" height=\"16\" />\nThe second of these can be reduced to \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/a/baa1f5c639194187ddad1036d6b4bb3d4ada662b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3x + 16y + 51z = 879.\\]\" width=\"173\" height=\"16\" />\nNow we substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> from the first new equation into the other new equation.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/3/023202aff61bf26fad87e3cfba65d67327eb934d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = 163 - 2y - 3z\\]\" width=\"142\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/f/b8f72cfe7798221c814ad09dbd829b75c55fc731.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3(163 - 2y - 3z) + 16y + 51z = 879\\]\" width=\"281\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/4/30478cb0ed3a311ffd40ef087fea203d48f1382b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[489 + 10y + 42z = 879\\]\" width=\"177\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/0/e607b9dbd6db04ee38bfc295f50ddcbdc88908f2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5y + 21z = 195\\]\" width=\"118\" height=\"16\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> are integers, the two solutions to this are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/c/5cc051b335bef197e6fa6e3b21f4ce54a258b7d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y,z) = (39,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"113\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/f/14f845fd5c5180e2b9a7cba05cd1c3187ed6ab22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(18,5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" />.\nIf you plug both these solutions in to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/4/7f4caea56d945d0b6e49701b42ce06e0fb92e663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> it is apparent that the second one returns a smaller value. It turns out that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/8/338350dc0aec51ec76688d940443f9efdab66f98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w = 215$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"64\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/2/a32275016517c2a20a2d1746543ce62b0f0926f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 112$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/a/e5a1a2b5979a1a16d49f048563190c8e0d505e0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/a/5ea6b99ea3293e5352b1f13f1983391d9770aed5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 5$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/9/b992ab66cdab49f2568ec39ac743d473cb53ef8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_2 = 215 + 4*112 + 9*18 + 16*5 = 215 + 448 + 162 + 80 = \\boxed{905}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"533\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I\" title=\"2009 AIME I\">2009 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2009\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2009 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017220644\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 285/1000